# What stays out of the .vsix.
#
# Tests and their configuration are the bulk of it: they run in this repository
# and have no meaning on a user's disk. `project.json` is Nx's view of this
# directory and travels no further.
#
# `node_modules` is deliberately NOT listed. The extension has one runtime
# dependency and it has to ship inside the package — an extension host does not
# install anything.
**/*.test.mjs
vitest.config.mjs
project.json
.vscodeignore
